{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1244241-aberrant-inspiration-ideas","id":1244241,"title":"Aberrant - Inspiration & Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-09T12:18:29-07:00","id":1244241,"title":"Aberrant - Inspiration & Ideas","content":"So I've been running an Aberrant game using a modified rule-set but I love the setting! I have been having trouble coming up with adventures or finding similar tabletop rpgs to grab inspiration from.<br /> <br /> I've looked at AMP, Wild Talents, GURPs, M&amp;M Paragons and a few other source-books.<br /> <br /> If anyone has any recommendations or suggestions for adventures, factions, or works that may provide some inspiration - I would appreciate it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Thanks ^-^<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T16:29:16-07:00","id":1244312,"title":"","content":"First, awesome to you! I wish luck and fun on your adventure. <br /> <br /> If you haven't checked it out I recommend Godbound by Kevin Crawford. It's got a lot of useful systems that aid in those things you might need. Same with Stars Without Number Revised, and Silent Legion. <br /> <br /> Hope this helps","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T17:44:30-07:00","id":1244330,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1244241-aberrant-inspiration-ideas?p=1244312#post1244312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First, awesome to you! I wish luck and fun on your adventure.<br /> <br /> If you haven't checked it out I recommend Godbound by Kevin Crawford. It's got a lot of useful systems that aid in those things you might need. Same with Stars Without Number Revised, and Silent Legion.<br /> <br /> Hope this helps</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey LordHeru <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> - This is a huge help. I took a brief look at Godbound but I didn't look in-depth, I'll give it another shot <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> . And hadn't heard about the others so it definetly helps!<br /> <br /> Thanks for the information!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T10:33:00-07:00","id":1244548,"title":"","content":"I can recommend City of Mist and Part-Time Gods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T11:38:02-07:00","id":1244582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NullApostle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1244241-aberrant-inspiration-ideas?p=1244548#post1244548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can recommend City of Mist and Part-Time Gods.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks NullApostle, I'll take a look - it should be a big help!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-20T17:49:58-08:00","id":1290157,"title":"","content":"Have you tried mining any conspiracy books for ideas? From Jim Marrs there is &quot;Our Occulted History,&quot; &quot;The Trillion-Dollar Conspiracy,&quot; and &quot;The Rise of the Fourth Reich.&quot; From David Wilcock(he's the blond guy on Ancient Aliens) there is &quot;The Ascension Mysteries,&quot; &quot;The Synchronicity Key,&quot; and &quot;The Source Field Investigation.&quot; &quot;The Ascension Mysteries&quot; are mostly autobiographical, you can skip the first 13 chapters and you won't miss anything. Books next to these at your local library are also likely to be conspiracy related so give them a peek, they might have something useful to your needs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1869-moonwolf8","name":"moonwolf8","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}